  if(currentModal==='help')return '<div class="modal-bg" onclick="if(event.target===this)DL.closeModal()"><div class="modal" style="max-width:640px"><h3>Judgment \u2014 Critical Thinking</h3><div class="sub">Leadership Edge \u00B7 Module 1</div><div style="background:rgba(232,98,26,.06);border-left:2px solid var(--gold);padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:28px;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:17px;font-style:italic;font-weight:300;line-height:1.55;color:var(--gold-pale)">AI makes producing effortless. The skill that matters now is deciding.</div><div style="margin-bottom:24px"><div class="section-label" style="margin-bottom:12px">How It Works</div><p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--stone);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:12px">The Judgment \u2014 Critical Thinking app guides you through a structured sequence that deliberately slows you down. You\u2019ll frame the problem, argue both sides, check for biases, run a pre-mortem, make a provisional decision, face an AI-generated challenge, then make your final call. When you\u2019ve lived with the decision, you come back to debrief \u2014 and the lesson becomes part of your Playbook.</p><div style="display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:16px"><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:32px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start"><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;font-weight:300;color:var(--gold)">01</div><div><div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--paper);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:2px">The Problem</div><div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--stone);line-height:1.6">Frame what you\u2019re deciding, state your leaning, check if you\u2019ve considered enough options.</div></div></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:32px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start"><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;font-weight:300;color:var(--gold)">02</div><div><div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--paper);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:2px">The Case</div><div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--stone);line-height:1.6">Build the strongest argument for and against your leaning. Then take the friend test.</div></div></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:32px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start"><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;font-weight:300;color:var(--gold)">03</div><div><div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--paper);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:2px">Bias Check</div><div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--stone);line-height:1.6">Three targeted checks for confirmation bias, sunk cost, and anchoring.</div></div></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:32px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start"><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;font-weight:300;color:var(--gold)">04</div><div><div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--paper);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:2px">Stress Test</div><div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--stone);line-height:1.6">Find what would make you wrong, imagine failure, identify the earliest warning sign.</div></div></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:32px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start"><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;font-weight:300;color:var(--gold)">05</div><div><div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--paper);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:2px">Decide \u2192 Challenge \u2192 Final Call</div><div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--stone);line-height:1.6">Make a provisional decision, face an AI-generated challenge based on everything you wrote, then confirm or change your call.</div></div></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:32px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start"><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;font-weight:300;color:var(--gold)">06</div><div><div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--paper);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:2px">Debrief</div><div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--stone);line-height:1.6">Come back after you\u2019ve lived with the decision. What you learned closes the loop \u2014 and becomes your Playbook on the Dashboard.</div></div></div></div></div><div style="text-align:center;padding-top:8px"><button class="btn-gold" onclick="DL.closeModal()">Got It</button></div></div></div>';

